Date: Mon, 18 Dec 2023 17:05:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 090/103] Screenrecord: Fix notifications not being dismissed

...after using actions such as "delete" or "share".
Post / Recieve the notification ID with the intent for that.
Also count grouped notifications to decide when to dismiss the group
summary and only close QS after all notifications are dismissed.

Change-Id: I1023367412b2b737b1cf3e9935b1d268059a2a3d
